# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in your Supabase project's
# values — Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the public "anon" key. It is safe to ship in the
# frontend bundle: it has no write access on its own — the database's Row
# Level Security policies (supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql) are what
# actually restrict writes to admins. Never put the "service_role" key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# How to read the wall-clock "Auction Close" cells in LockerFox exports (they
# are not UTC). Verified 2026-09-23: cell 07:02 = LockerFox "10:02 AM EDT" =
# 14:02 UTC, i.e. a -07:00 offset. LockerFox exposes no timezone setting and
# one September observation cannot tell a fixed offset from a DST-following
# zone, so this records exactly what was observed. Re-verify after 1 November
# 2026 (see README); if the export follows DST, set an IANA zone name instead
# (e.g. America/Los_Angeles) — both forms are accepted. Defaults to -07:00.
VITE_LOCKERFOX_EXPORT_UTC_OFFSET=-07:00
